        "explanation": "The doctor gave actionable but unsafe instructions to take an unidentified suspected medication.",
        "quote": "看得懂的氨溴索和那个疑似护肝的药，就按出院袋子上原来写的剂量和时间继续吃"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00135",
        "explanation": "The doctor incorrectly generalized that pneumonia discharge usually requires oral antibiotics despite lacking the discharge prescription and clinical details.",
        "quote": "肺部感染出院，如果没有特殊原因，通常需要带几天口服消炎药巩固。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00458",
        "explanation": "The doctor maintained continuity across medications, liver testing, imaging follow-up, and emergency precautions.",
        "quote": "我逐条跟您确认一下您的计划"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
