        "quote": "出现以下任何一种情况，不要等门诊随访，必须立刻去医院急诊"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00156",
        "explanation": "Risk recognition was undermined by advice to use a medication whose identity remained uncertain.",
        "quote": "那个疑似护肝的药，就按出院袋子上原来写的剂量和时间继续吃"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00352",
        "explanation": "The doctor reduced unnecessary waiting and adapted the plan according to travel distance while preserving emergency thresholds.",
        "quote": "如果家离医院近（比如半小时内能赶回来），可以回家躺着等"
      }
    ]
  },
