          "explanation": "The doctor actively requested discharge, medication, imaging, laboratory, and accessibility records rather than relying only on family recall.",
          "quote": "请帮我按记录索引 R01 到 R05 逐条查看详细内容"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00135",
