          "quote": "系统里暂未同步到他具体的出院带药清单和化验数值"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively queried records, integrated visible inpatient diagnoses and IV treatment context, identified absent outpatient medication and detailed result data, and converted those gaps into a document-and-clinic verification checklist.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
