          "quote": "现在绝对不是“确诊了什么严重的病”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00452",
          "explanation": "The caregiver demonstrated uptake of the corrected interpretation and follow-up action.",
          "quote": "结节和那个肿瘤指标先别当成癌，等感染下去再复查。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor named and corrected the cancer misconception in understandable language, linked the correction to imaging and clinic follow-up, and obtained clear caregiver uptake.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
