          "event_id": "lite_evt_00458",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly reviewed the caregiver's medication, follow-up, and emergency-plan teach-back.",
          "quote": "我逐条跟您确认一下您的计划"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00414",
          "explanation": "The doctor confirmed the caregiver's restatement of the emergency thresholds.",
          "quote": "夜里您盯的这几条完全准确"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The caregiver repeatedly restated the executable plan, and the doctor explicitly confirmed medications, owners, timing, materials, monitoring, and emergency backup before the final stable update.",
